+<!--
+Kolom 01: A pentagon upright/square TL; B hexagon/square TR; C pentagon rotated/square TL; D hexagon rotated/square BL; E pentagon rotated/square BR. Hard pair: A-C (pentagon rotation only).
+Kolom 02: A lower-left triangle/circle TL/square TR; B lower-right/TL/BL; C lower-left/TR/TR; D upper-right/BL/TL; E upper-left/BR/BL. Hard pair: A-C (circle position only).
+Kolom 03: A up arrow/two white triangles; B right arrow/two white-black triangles; C down arrow/three triangles; D left arrow/three triangles; E right arrow/first triangle grey. Hard pair: B-E (one triangle fill only).
+Kolom 04: A vertical bowtie/top black/dot left; B diagonal/dot TR; C diagonal/dot BL; D horizontal/left black/dot top; E horizontal/left black/dot bottom. Hard pair: D-E (dot side only).
+Kolom 05: A clockwise pinwheel/N-E black; B mirrored/E-S black; C mirrored/N-S black; D clockwise/N black; E clockwise/S-W black. Hard pair: A-D (east blade fill only).
+Kolom 06: A right crescent/cross inside black; B right/outside black; C right/outside white; D left/outside white; E upward/inside grey. Hard pair: B-C (cross fill only).
+Kolom 07: A upright star/two circles TL white BR black; B right star/three circles; C upright/TL grey BR black; D inverted/three circles; E rotated/three circles. Hard pair: A-C (TL circle fill only).
+Kolom 08: A L rotated right/grey foot; B top L/grey TL; C mirrored top L/grey BR; D top L/grey TR; E bottom L/grey lower-left. Hard pair: B-D (grey cell only).
+Kolom 09: A white outer/black diamond/square TL; B black outer/white diamond/BL; C grey outer/black diamond/BR; D white outer/grey diamond/BL; E white outer/black diamond/TR. Hard pair: A-E (small-square corner only).
+Kolom 10: A downward triangle/squares left; B flipped trapezoid/squares lower-left; C lower trapezoid/white below black square; D upward triangle/squares lower-left; E lower trapezoid/black below white square. Hard pair: C-E (overlap order only).
